"The Anesidoran Capitol is a trapezoid of glass and black stone, much like LeafSong's hot lab."
"It houses the High Council's chambers and the offices of the class representatives."
"Each Avowed class has a representative; the Rabbit councilor has little power unless President."
"The Rabbit councilor is a short woman with silver corkscrew curls."
"Intake tours of government buildings reach it by train through F City."
